  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/07/IMG_3328.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">(20 fotos) El saxofonista ingl&eacute;s Simon Taylor, con su tr&iacute;o formado tambi&eacute;n por Tico Porcar a la bater&iacute;a y Gary Jackson al bajo, ha estrenado el &#39;escenario&#39; en la avenida Sierra Espad&aacute;n de Onda, Espais de Jazz, que este s&aacute;bado se ha trasladado tambi&eacute;n a la zona norte, <a href=\"http://www.eltriangulo.es/contenidos/?p=57394\" target=\"_blank\">tras la suspensi&oacute;n por lluvia la semana pasada al principio del concierto frente al Caf&eacute; Colonial</a>.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/07/OndaEspaisJazzJuliol152.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 679px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">El ciclo finaliza el domingo 2 de agosto, a las 19,30 horas, en el Raval de Sant Josep, dentro del programa de fiestas del Salvador, con el habitual festival de la Onda Big Band, que este a&ntilde;o tiene como invitada a la del Alto Palancia.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/simontaylorondaespaisjazz15/img_3326.jpg\" alt=\"img_3326\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/simontaylorondaespaisjazz15/img_3327.jpg\" alt=\"img_3327\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/simontaylorondaespaisjazz15/img_3328.jpg\" alt=\"img_3328\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/simontaylorondaespaisjazz15/img_3329.jpg\" alt=\"img_3329\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/simontaylorondaespaisjazz15/img_3331.jpg\" alt=\"img_3331\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/simontaylorondaespaisjazz15/img_3332.jpg\" alt=\"img_3332\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/simontaylorondaespaisjazz15/img_3333.jpg\" alt=\"img_3333\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/simontaylorondaespaisjazz15/img_3334.jpg\" alt=\"img_3334\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/simontaylorondaespaisjazz15/img_3336.jpg\" alt=\"img_3336\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/simontaylorondaespaisjazz15/img_3337.jpg\" alt=\"img_3337\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/simontaylorondaespaisjazz15/img_3339.jpg\" alt=\"img_3339\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/simontaylorondaespaisjazz15/img_3341.jpg\" alt=\"img_3341\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/simontaylorondaespaisjazz15/img_3343.jpg\" alt=\"img_3343\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/simontaylorondaespaisjazz15/img_3344.jpg\" alt=\"img_3344\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/simontaylorondaespaisjazz15/img_3345.jpg\" alt=\"img_3345\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/simontaylorondaespaisjazz15/img_3346.jpg\" alt=\"img_3346\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/simontaylorondaespaisjazz15/img_3348.jpg\" alt=\"img_3348\" style=\